"The Empire was once the Arcanocracy of Aiesta; almost no one now alive knows that name."
"Fateweavers built modern arcanophany on glyphs some 3,800 years ago, averting a collapse."
"The Emperor knows the truth of the Fateweavers and is kept immune to prophetic links."
"The throne and the Academy's Demiurge are two checks on the Fateweavers, held by their leave."
"Demiurge Caldwell urged the Emperor to call arcanists into service, of his own accord."
"The Fateweavers keep the Empire ignorant of the outside world by prophecy and social engineering."
"Aiesta supplies much of the world's artefacts; nations that cooperate with it prosper."
"Unknown powers from outside the Empire are at work in the attacks, hidden even from the augera."
